    "preamble": "B.Hemambaradara Rao vs State Of Ap on 31 December, 2019 Author: C.Praveen Kumar Bench: C.Praveen Kumar The Honourable Sri Justice C.Praveen Kumar Criminal Petition No.5855 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "- This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioners/A-1 to A-3 under Section 482 of the Criminal Procedure Code, 1973 to quash the proceedings in F.I.R.No.255 of 2019, dated 16.09.2019, of Bapatla Town Police Station, Guntur District. The offences alleged are under Sections 328, 420, 270 and 273 I.P.C. and Sections 56 and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners so also the learned Public Prosecutor submits that the issue involved in the present case is squarely covered by the common order, dated 18.12.2019, of this Court in Criminal Petition No.5421 of 2019 and batch.",
